From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 08:12:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor CPU: Present waits for the GPU in short sleeps instead
 of a 100 percent spin (ed_present_wait), frame rate limiter in the main loop
 (ed_fps_limit / ed_fps_loading / ed_fps_background / ed_fps_idle, input never
 waits), main thread no longer pinned to one core, SC_VerticalSync applies its
 argument, thread names for the system, big normal map updates on the worker
 pool (ed_par_normalmap), ed_perf_loop / ed_perf_threads, tests
 (EdPerfPolicyTest, EdNormalMapParTest)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

